Phase 7 – Project Documentation

1. Project Title
FitBuddy – AI Fitness Plan Generator using Gemini Models

2. Project Overview
FitBuddy is an AI-powered fitness application that uses Google Gemini models to generate personalized fitness plans based on user-provided fitness information and goals.

3. Problem Statement
Many people want to start or improve their fitness routine but may not know which exercises or workout schedules are suitable for them. FitBuddy aims to provide an easy-to-use AI-based solution for generating personalized fitness guidance.

4. Project Objectives
Collect basic fitness information from users.
Understand the user's fitness goal.
Generate personalized workout recommendations.
Provide a weekly workout schedule.
Provide general nutrition suggestions.
Use Gemini AI to generate responses.

5. Technologies Used
Frontend: HTML, CSS, JavaScript
AI Model: Google Gemini
Code Editor: Visual Studio Code
Version Control: GitHub
Browser: Google Chrome

6. System Workflow
User enters details
 ↓
 Selects fitness goal
 ↓
 Application processes information
 ↓
 Request sent to Gemini AI
 ↓
 Gemini generates fitness plan
 ↓
 Plan displayed to user

7. Main Features
User fitness information form
Fitness goal selection
AI-generated workout plan
Exercise recommendations
Weekly schedule
General nutrition suggestions
Regenerate plan option

8. Testing Summary
The application is tested using different user inputs to verify:
Input validation
Button functionality
Gemini response generation
Fitness plan display
Error handling
User interface functionality

9. Expected Benefits
Easy to use for beginners.
Saves time in planning workouts.
Provides personalized AI-generated suggestions.
Demonstrates the practical use of Generative AI.

10. Limitations
The generated information depends on the quality of the user's input and AI response.
The application requires an internet connection for Gemini AI.
AI-generated fitness guidance should not replace professional medical or fitness advice.

11. Future Enhancements
User login and profile management.
Progress tracking.
Workout reminders.
Exercise demonstration videos.
Improved personalization.
Mobile application version.

12. Conclusion
FitBuddy demonstrates how Google Gemini models can be used to create an AI-powered fitness plan generator. The application accepts user fitness information and generates personalized fitness suggestions through Generative AI.
